 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” HVAC company for every Atlanta home, but **PV Heating & Air** looks like a strong first company to get a quote from: its Atlanta service page reports a 4.9 Google rating and more than 2,000 five-star reviews. **Bell Mechanical** is another option; its BBB profile lists it as accredited with an A+ rating and says it handles cooling-system replacement.\n\nBefore choosing, get **at least three written estimates** and compare more than the equipment price. Ask each company to:\n- Size the system based on your home—not simply match the old unit.\n- Itemize equipment, labor, permits, ductwork, and any add-ons.\n- Explain parts and labor warranties, and who handles warranty service.\n- Provide proof of licensing and insurance.\n\nRatings and availability can change, so check recent reviews and confirm the company serves your address.",
